	(text "169MHz IF + Si4463 receiver (2026-09-28). LT5560 up-converts 50MHz -> 168.3-169.2MHz (LO = Si5351 CLK0, 118.2MHz fixed).\nL5/L6: LT5560 open-collector IF output feeds, value per LT5560 datasheet output network at 169MHz.\nL7-L9 / C18-C22: 3-pole top-C-coupled LC band-pass, ~168.75MHz, ~3-5MHz BW, 50 ohm -- values TBD (design + SPICE).\nC23/L10/C24: Si4463 differential LNA match -- PLACEHOLDER topology, take topology + values from Silicon Labs AN643 (169MHz).\nU9 receive-only: TX/TXRAMP/GPIO unused. See RX_Hardware/RX_Design_Details.md section 3."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
